WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.580
<b>Astrea Familia</b>

00:00.000 --> 00:03.580
<b>Heroic Death</b>

00:42.880 --> 00:44.290
<b>Yeesh, that was close!</b>

00:44.960 --> 00:46.670
<b>So it was a trap.</b>

00:47.500 --> 00:49.960
<b>But trying to bury us alive with bombs?</b>

00:51.250 --> 00:53.460
<b>That's both tacky and laughable.</b>

00:57.420 --> 00:59.380
<b>How the hell did they survive...?</b>

01:00.000 --> 01:02.540
<b>Damn you Astrea Familia bitches!</b>

01:02.920 --> 01:06.000
<b>Do you have any idea how much
those Blazerocks cost us?!</b>

01:06.210 --> 01:08.250
<b>Well of course we survived!</b>

01:08.250 --> 01:11.000
<b>In case you forgot, we're the Astrea Familia.</b>

01:11.290 --> 01:13.380
<b>Still, an explosion of that size...</b>

01:14.210 --> 01:16.880
<b>You must've spent quite a bit of time planting them.</b>

01:16.880 --> 01:19.290
<b>Too bad it was all for nothing...</b>

01:19.290 --> 01:21.830
<b>G..gods-dammit!</b>

01:22.250 --> 01:26.830
<b>Prepare yourself, Jura!
We're putting a stop to your sinster plot!</b>

01:27.170 --> 01:28.790
<b>There's nowhere left to run!</b>

01:29.170 --> 01:30.920
<b>We're going to finish this now!</b>

01:31.880 --> 01:36.460
<b>And you will answer for your crimes...
Every last one of them!</b>

01:38.040 --> 01:42.080
<b>Let's put an end to this.
To Evilus and to their reign of terror!</b>

01:47.130 --> 01:51.330
<b>G-gimme a break! I won't let it end in a place like this!</b>

02:00.670 --> 02:01.750
<b>What's that sound?!</b>

02:33.330 --> 02:34.040
<b>Huh?</b>

02:41.460 --> 02:43.290
<b>N-NEUN!</b>

03:16.580 --> 03:17.670
<b>Don't do it, Lion!</b>

03:27.080 --> 03:28.000
<b>Idiot!</b>

03:45.920 --> 03:48.380
<b>Celty, on my mark... Open fire!</b>

04:12.790 --> 04:14.790
<b>Celty... Ryana...</b>

04:27.540 --> 04:29.080
<b>NOOOOO!</b>

04:37.880 --> 04:38.790
<b>Marrue!</b>

04:40.580 --> 04:42.580
<b>DON'T EAT ME!</b>

04:57.330 --> 04:59.420
<b>Alise...</b>

04:59.710 --> 05:02.290
<b>S-stop! Stay back!</b>

05:16.420 --> 05:20.460
<b>Kaguya, Lion... You okay?</b>

05:23.000 --> 05:28.080
<b>If we look "okay" to you...
then you might need your eyes checked, Captain.</b>

05:29.710 --> 05:33.250
<b>Physical injuries aside, it looks like Lion's in shock.</b>

05:33.960 --> 05:35.880
<b>She's in no shape to fight right now.</b>

05:37.790 --> 05:39.250
<b>Alise...</b>

05:42.630 --> 05:45.460
<b>I'm sorry... It got me, too.</b>

05:45.830 --> 05:48.920
<b>Dammit, I can't see a thing...</b>

06:00.710 --> 06:06.500
<b>Forgive me, you two,
but I need you to lay down your lives. I...</b>

06:07.040 --> 06:08.380
<b>...want to save Lion.</b>

06:10.750 --> 06:12.790
<b>Sure. Count me in.</b>

06:13.670 --> 06:16.420
<b>My life is more important to me than anyone else's.</b>

06:16.750 --> 06:21.460
<b>But if I were to try and fight blind,
I'd probably be the first to kick the bucket anyway.</b>

06:21.750 --> 06:25.500
<b>Yeah. If I die here, then so be it.</b>

06:26.330 --> 06:28.830
<b>It means that the time has come to make our choice.</b>

06:29.330 --> 06:32.750
<b>But Captain, shouldn't you be the one to survive?</b>

06:33.580 --> 06:37.830
<b>So long as you and Lady Astrea are alive,
true justice will prevail.</b>

06:38.580 --> 06:39.960
<b>No, Kaguya...</b>

06:40.790 --> 06:43.040
<b>There are as many types of justice as there are people.</b>

06:43.580 --> 06:47.420
<b>How do you define "justice"? I still don't know the answer.</b>

06:48.580 --> 06:52.250
<b>But I know Lion... She always does the right thing.</b>

06:53.330 --> 06:55.420
<b>She stays true to her own justice.</b>

06:59.960 --> 07:05.880
<b>Listen to me, Lion. We need your magic to kill that thing.</b>

07:08.250 --> 07:10.380
<b>We're going to tear off its shell.</b>

07:11.790 --> 07:15.130
<b>So you stay here and start chanting, okay?</b>

07:19.580 --> 07:22.630
<b>Please... Promise me, Lion.</b>

07:27.460 --> 07:31.830
<b>And be sure to make it happen someday.
Those ideals of yours.</b>

07:40.630 --> 07:42.170
<b>Bye for now, Lion.</b>

07:43.960 --> 07:45.670
<b>Y'there, Lion?</b>

07:46.880 --> 07:48.380
<b>Live enough for the rest of us.</b>

07:50.460 --> 07:55.080
<b>I'm giving these to you. Don't just keep them, USE them.</b>

07:55.710 --> 07:58.920
<b>Stay strong out there, my archrival.</b>

08:15.830 --> 08:19.710
<b>Now in the skies... of the distant forest...</b>

08:22.210 --> 08:28.500
<b>...to the infinite stars mounted upon the...
eternal firmament of night...</b>

08:30.250 --> 08:35.500
<b>This fool doth entreat, just once for the...
divine protection of the stars' fire...</b>

08:43.170 --> 08:47.460
<b>Grant thy benevolent light...
to the one who abandoned thee...</b>

08:48.460 --> 08:52.000
<b>Come forth, wandering wind... my fellow drifter...</b>

08:52.330 --> 08:54.380
<b>AGALLIS ARVESYNTH!</b>

08:54.380 --> 09:01.750
<b>Cross the skies, speed through the wastelands...
race more swiftly than any other...</b>

09:03.750 --> 09:07.750
<b>Let the light of stardust occupy me
and strike my enemy...</b>

09:19.830 --> 09:21.330
<b>ARVELIA!</b>

09:35.460 --> 09:36.460
<b>Ryu...</b>

09:37.580 --> 09:40.210
<b>LUMINOUS WIND!</b>

09:59.500 --> 10:03.540
<b>A wave of emotions washed over me.</b>

10:04.460 --> 10:06.580
<b>Devastated by the loss my friends...</b>

10:07.170 --> 10:08.920
<b>Enraged that I couldn't finish the job...</b>

10:09.670 --> 10:11.460
<b>Confused as to how it escaped...</b>

10:11.830 --> 10:17.040
<b>And ashamed that I had somehow survived,
despite bearing the mark of incompetence...</b>

10:17.920 --> 10:22.420
<b>I was resolved not to lose my life there.
My friends' deaths would have been in vain.</b>

10:23.670 --> 10:28.880
<b>I left, albeit begrudgingly,
to avoid attracting monsters to the area.</b>

10:31.460 --> 10:33.250
<b>When I returned to the surface,</b>

10:33.630 --> 10:37.250
<b>I couldn't bring myself to set foot in our Familia home
because it reminded me of Alise.</b>

10:38.460 --> 10:41.750
<b>Plus, I had no idea what to say to Lady Astrea.</b>

10:43.420 --> 10:51.460
<b>Once my wounds were healed, I went back to the 30th
Floor to give my friends a proper burial. However...</b>

10:52.710 --> 10:55.670
<b>...not a single one of their corpses remained.</b>

10:56.420 --> 10:58.830
<b>They were devoured by monsters, bones and all.</b>

11:00.380 --> 11:02.710
<b>And as for that thing...</b>

11:06.920 --> 11:10.880
<b>I had to fight. I was prepared to die.</b>

11:11.670 --> 11:16.880
<b>To avenge my friends... To be judged for my sins...</b>

11:23.880 --> 11:29.330
<b>What am I supposed to do now? Tell me, Alise...</b>

11:29.750 --> 11:32.170
<b>I felt utterly helpless.</b>

11:32.880 --> 11:37.170
<b>My duty to stay alive and my longing for death blurred
together. It tormented me to no end.</b>

11:37.540 --> 11:41.790
<b>Before long, the pain began
to turn into despicable thoughts.</b>

11:42.210 --> 11:44.920
<b>They'll pay for this...</b>

11:46.040 --> 11:50.830
<b>The Rudra Familia... Jura...</b>

11:52.290 --> 11:54.420
<b>If it's the last thing I do...</b>

11:55.500 --> 11:58.210
<b>It wasn't what anyone would've called "justice."</b>

11:59.540 --> 12:02.250
<b>Neither a noble cause nor an ideal...</b>

12:03.000 --> 12:05.080
<b>It was hatred, plain and simple.</b>

12:08.210 --> 12:09.250
<b>I'm begging you!</b>

12:12.790 --> 12:18.210
<b>I pleaded with Lady Astrea to leave Orario,
no questions asked.</b>

12:19.040 --> 12:22.880
<b>My emotions were dictating my actions,
and I didn't want to be seen like that.</b>

12:24.380 --> 12:28.790
<b>But most of all, I wouldn't let anyone get
in the way of my plan.</b>

12:30.790 --> 12:31.750
<b>Okay then.</b>

12:38.130 --> 12:41.000
<b>Ryu, you should give up on justice.</b>

12:43.830 --> 12:47.920
<b>I was excommunicated by the Goddess of Justice.</b>

12:49.250 --> 12:53.580
<b>She didn't rescind her Blessing,
though that was probably an act of mercy on her part...</b>

12:55.080 --> 13:00.130
<b>The justice I'd championed went up in smoke,
leaving a pitiful pile of ashes in its place.</b>

13:02.790 --> 13:04.750
<b>That's when the bloodbath began.</b>

13:05.540 --> 13:10.880
<b>People, buildings, and command posts
with ties to the Rudra Familia or Evilus.</b>

13:11.670 --> 13:16.670
<b>I didn't give the other Familias time to intervene.
I destroyed it all.</b>

13:17.330 --> 13:22.330
<b>Sneaking in at night, planning ambushes,
laying traps... No method was beneath me.</b>

13:23.210 --> 13:27.920
<b>Succumbing to my emotions, I cut down evil...
along with anyone who seemed suspicious.</b>

13:29.290 --> 13:31.630
<b>Not once did I pause to consider the consequences.</b>

13:32.960 --> 13:35.580
<b>I was looking for somewhere to dig my grave.</b>

13:37.130 --> 13:38.080
<b>And then...</b>

13:38.420 --> 13:40.330
<b>I-it's Gale Wind!</b>

13:48.290 --> 13:51.380
<b>D-damn you, Lion...!</b>

13:52.670 --> 13:53.330
<b>Jura.</b>

13:54.330 --> 13:56.580
<b>You're going to PAY for what you've done!</b>

14:00.960 --> 14:03.380
<b>Everything after that gets kind of hazy.</b>

14:04.330 --> 14:09.500
<b>Blinded by white-hot rage, I attacked Jura.
I stabbed him over and over with my blade.</b>

14:11.670 --> 14:17.080
<b>And while he did live, I wouldn't find
that out until much later on.</b>

14:19.580 --> 14:21.380
<b>Not bad, little Elf!</b>

14:21.880 --> 14:26.210
<b>Oh? You'd go so far as to murder a god in cold blood?</b>

14:29.710 --> 14:31.540
<b>If looks could kill, am I right?</b>

14:32.210 --> 14:38.000
<b>The expression on your face makes think
I ought to recruit you into my Familia.</b>

14:45.670 --> 14:47.500
<b>I had exacted my revenge.</b>

14:49.130 --> 14:52.830
<b>And yet, somehow, I had survived.</b>

14:55.420 --> 14:59.040
<b>I wanted to die. I couldn't die.</b>

14:59.750 --> 15:03.960
<b>I was engulfed by a vast emptiness. I felt nothing else.</b>

15:08.040 --> 15:10.880
<b>Why had I been left alive?</b>

15:12.000 --> 15:14.960
<b>What had I wielded all those blades for?</b>

15:16.000 --> 15:22.670
<b>Do I go on living since my friends sacrificed themselves
for me? Or should I die as punishment for my crimes?</b>

15:23.630 --> 15:27.460
<b>I had no purpose. I didn't know
what to do with myself anymore.</b>

15:29.670 --> 15:34.330
<b>That was around the time Syr rescued me,
just like Alise had.</b>

15:35.210 --> 15:38.210
<b>No... I didn't want it this time.</b>

15:39.750 --> 15:42.630
<b>I had yet to be judged for my sins...</b>

15:56.420 --> 15:57.330
<b>You guys...!</b>

15:58.960 --> 16:01.920
<b>Kaguya, Lyla! Say something!</b>

16:02.710 --> 16:06.580
<b>Neese, Marrue! Take me with you!</b>

16:06.580 --> 16:11.500
<b>Ryana! Asta! Neun! Isuka! Celty!</b>

16:16.420 --> 16:17.960
<b>Alise!</b>

16:19.380 --> 16:21.920
<b>Please don't leave me all alone!</b>

16:31.420 --> 16:33.130
<b>M-Mr. Cranel?</b>

16:33.670 --> 16:35.710
<b>Miss Ryu... Thank goodness.</b>

16:38.000 --> 16:39.580
<b>Where are we...?</b>

16:40.670 --> 16:44.040
<b>I remember being surrounded
by monsters in the Colosseum...</b>

16:46.830 --> 16:49.420
<b>The Colosseum's floor was destroyed by the explosion...</b>

16:50.130 --> 16:51.420
<b>Did we fall through it?</b>

16:52.540 --> 16:55.040
<b>There was a passageway right
below us this whole time...?</b>

16:56.330 --> 16:58.380
<b>Let's keep... moving.</b>

17:06.330 --> 17:09.000
<b>Why? Give me a reason!</b>

17:09.750 --> 17:12.830
<b>Why did you save me, Mr. Cranel?!</b>

17:13.210 --> 17:15.540
<b>Why didn't you leave me behind?!</b>

17:15.710 --> 17:16.750
<b>Answer me!</b>

17:18.210 --> 17:22.670
<b>Because... you would do the same for me, Miss Ryu.</b>

17:23.790 --> 17:27.130
<b>No, I wouldn't! I wouldn't save you if it meant-</b>

17:27.130 --> 17:27.880
<b>That's a lie.</b>

17:29.040 --> 17:32.330
<b>Put me down. Leave me here and go!</b>

17:32.330 --> 17:33.290
<b>I can't.</b>

17:33.880 --> 17:35.920
<b>I'm not going to let you die.</b>

17:36.380 --> 17:37.880
<b>Then YOU'RE going to die!</b>

17:39.330 --> 17:44.830
<b>That's enough, Mr. Cranel. Don't waste any more
of your strength on me than you already have!</b>

17:45.460 --> 17:47.920
<b>Don't do this... I'm begging you to stop!</b>

17:48.710 --> 17:51.670
<b>Lion, live enough for the rest of us.</b>

17:52.580 --> 17:54.580
<b>Let me die here with them!</b>

17:58.830 --> 18:01.500
<b>I'm a filthy criminal...</b>

18:02.380 --> 18:06.830
<b>I let my Familia die and murdered
my dearest friend with my own two hands.</b>

18:07.330 --> 18:09.540
<b>I was the only one who walked away with her life...</b>

18:10.710 --> 18:15.830
<b>I let despicable thoughts consume me. I killed people.</b>

18:16.580 --> 18:18.580
<b>There was no justice in that.</b>

18:19.920 --> 18:23.420
<b>The very thing that my friends risked their lives for,
that they trusted me with...</b>

18:23.710 --> 18:27.290
<b>Just like Lady Astrea said, I gave it up.</b>

18:28.710 --> 18:30.630
<b>There's no justice left in me.</b>

18:31.580 --> 18:35.920
<b>I don't deserve to be rescued by you. So please-</b>

18:35.920 --> 18:38.960
<b>Stuff like justice... I don't know much about it.</b>

18:39.330 --> 18:43.420
<b>But... you've given me so many things, Miss Ryu.</b>

18:44.710 --> 18:47.130
<b>And that's GOT to be justice.</b>

18:48.960 --> 18:51.420
<b>You've saved other adventurers' lives...</b>

18:53.130 --> 18:57.920
<b>Goddess Hestia, Lili, Welf, me...</b>

18:58.710 --> 19:01.170
<b>You've saved my life countless times.</b>

19:03.710 --> 19:06.960
<b>In my eyes, you were always the hero.</b>

19:08.130 --> 19:11.580
<b>A righteous champion of justice
who swoops in and saves us...</b>

19:11.580 --> 19:14.920
<b>N-no... I was wrong!</b>

19:15.210 --> 19:18.250
<b>I cast justice aside and lost control of myself!</b>

19:19.130 --> 19:23.250
<b>I won't let anyone tell me otherwise.
Not even you, Miss Ryu.</b>

19:26.540 --> 19:28.710
<b>I don't know the old Miss Ryu.</b>

19:29.750 --> 19:33.130
<b>Maybe you did make a few mistakes.</b>

19:34.130 --> 19:40.920
<b>But... the Miss Ryu I know was always right.
She knew better than everyone.</b>

19:42.210 --> 19:46.420
<b>So you didn't give it up or cast it aside, Miss Ryu.</b>

19:48.580 --> 19:51.250
<b>That justice... It lives on.</b>

19:52.460 --> 19:55.830
<b>It lives on with you. In your heart.</b>

19:56.380 --> 19:59.920
<b>But I know Lion... She always does the right thing.</b>

20:02.000 --> 20:04.540
<b>Alise, I...</b>

20:06.670 --> 20:10.880
<b>And right now, my justice...
is making it home alive with you.</b>

20:11.500 --> 20:14.130
<b>So I'm never going to let you go!</b>

20:16.250 --> 20:17.920
<b>Maybe I can go home...</b>

20:18.540 --> 20:19.960
<b>So long as I'm with him...</b>

20:20.380 --> 20:21.920
<b>So long as I'm with Mr. Cranel...</b>

20:27.580 --> 20:28.710
<b>A Barbarian-?!</b>

20:33.330 --> 20:34.380
<b>Mr. Cranel!</b>

20:40.080 --> 20:41.960
<b>Wake up, Mr. Cranel!</b>

20:45.080 --> 20:46.830
<b>Say something!</b>

20:49.000 --> 20:49.830
<b>Bell!</b>

20:51.330 --> 20:53.960
<b>Bell... Bell, please...</b>

20:54.710 --> 20:56.000
<b>Speak to me...</b>

20:56.380 --> 21:00.000
<b>Don't... N-no, wait...</b>

21:09.290 --> 21:12.000
<b>BELL!</b>

21:18.540 --> 21:19.250
<b>Huh?</b>

21:21.250 --> 21:30.500
<b>Sorry about that. I heard you calling my name but...
I was trying to lure the monster in closer, and... um...</b>

21:37.420 --> 21:40.170
<b>I'm sorry for scaring you like that...</b>

21:44.380 --> 21:49.380
<b>I have a request... Please don't ever do that again.</b>

21:51.540 --> 21:53.710
<b>Okay. I promise.</b>

22:00.630 --> 22:02.130
<b>Miss Ryu, look.</b>

22:04.420 --> 22:05.750
<b>A blue light...?</b>

22:06.130 --> 22:07.290
<b>What is it?</b>

22:07.920 --> 22:11.750
<b>I'm not sure. This is the first time I've seen it.</b>

22:12.040 --> 22:12.960
<b>Let's check it out.</b>

22:16.630 --> 22:19.080
<b>Is that a... river?</b>

22:19.380 --> 22:25.920
<b>Yes, but... a water source on the 37th Floor?
I've never heard anyone mention anything like that...</b>

22:27.000 --> 22:29.750
<b>And it was sitting right underneath the Colosseum...</b>

22:30.290 --> 22:35.130
<b>Well, maybe no one knew it existed until now
since everyone steers clear of the area...</b>

22:35.670 --> 22:37.670
<b>Either way, we should take a break.</b>

22:44.710 --> 22:45.630
<b>Bell!</b>

22:50.250 --> 22:52.330
<b>The song of a now faraway forest...</b>

22:52.630 --> 22:54.580
<b>The comforting melody of life...</b>

22:55.080 --> 22:56.040
<b>Noah Heal.</b>

23:07.330 --> 23:09.540
<b>Good, it's potable.</b>

23:11.750 --> 23:14.250
<b>Drink some... Here.</b>

23:15.920 --> 23:18.630
<b>Please, you need water...</b>

23:27.460 --> 23:28.500
<b>Miss Ryu...</b>

23:31.210 --> 23:33.380
<b>Bell. Thank goodness...</b>

23:34.920 --> 23:39.920
<b>Next Time</b>

23:34.920 --> 23:39.920
<b>Daydream</b>

23:34.920 --> 23:39.920
<b>A Sweet Lie</b>

23:36.080 --> 23:38.460
<b>Next time: "Daydream."</b>
